From: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: MSFT-PATCH: Keep blocked yue out of generated ICU data

Exclude yue generation and forced aliases, and preserve the ICU 72 Hong Kong
RBNF fallback instead of referring to a blocked resource. Add C API regression
coverage for Hong Kong spellout and ordinal fallback.

